LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Your project list, settings, and past conversations. Project notes stay in your projects."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_SPANISH} "Tu lista de proyectos, la configuración y las conversaciones anteriores. Las notas de los proyectos se quedan en tus proyectos."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_FRENCH} "Votre liste de projets, vos paramètres et vos conversations passées. Les notes des projets restent dans vos projets."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_GERMAN} "Deine Projektliste, Einstellungen und bisherigen Unterhaltungen. Projektnotizen bleiben in deinen Projekten."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Sua lista de projetos, as configurações e as conversas anteriores. As notas dos projetos ficam nos seus projetos."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_ITALIAN} "L'elenco dei progetti, le impostazioni e le conversazioni passate. Le note dei progetti restano nei tuoi progetti."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_RUSSIAN} "Список проектов, настройки и прошлые разговоры. Заметки проектов остаются в ваших проектах."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_JAPANESE} "プロジェクトの一覧、設定、過去の会話。プロジェクトのノートはプロジェクトに残ります。"
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_KOREAN} "프로젝트 목록, 설정, 이전 대화. 프로젝트 노트는 프로젝트에 그대로 남습니다."
LangString UnDataDesc ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "你的项目列表、设置和以往的对话。项目笔记保留在你的项目中。"

LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloaded models (about $R3 GB)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_SPANISH} "Modelos descargados (unos $R3 GB)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_FRENCH} "Modèles téléchargés (environ $R3 Go)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_GERMAN} "Heruntergeladene Modelle (etwa $R3 GB)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Modelos baixados (cerca de $R3 GB)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Modelli scaricati (circa $R3 GB)"
LangString UnModelsName ${LANG_RUSSIAN} "Загруженные модели (около $R3 ГБ)"
